Subject: [EXPERIMENT] ASoC: audit mute retention across GRAPH_PREPARE

Apply only to the PA-off, clock-off fixture. Read mute again without
rewriting it. Keep graph START and amplifier unmute prohibited.

diff --git a/sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/audioreach.c b/sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/audioreach.c
